{"id":"86e3771995bb6290","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-typed-halting-set-notations.md","title":"73-df-typed-halting-set-notations — typed halting set notations","display":"73-df-typed-halting-set-notations — typed halting set notations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-typed-halting-set-notations","display":"73-df-typed-halting-set-notations — typed halting set notations","depends_on":["[[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]","[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","[[73-df-dtm-finite-runs]]","[[73-df-binary-diagonal-halting]]"],"aliases":["73-df-typed-halting-set-notations","73-definition-8.1"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-typed-halting-set-notations"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-typed-halting-set-notations — typed halting set notations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"219767ec839d8c84\" href=\"?note=219767ec839d8c84\" title=\"73-df-numeric-program-interface\">73-df-numeric-program-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8630ed136c8dde2d\" href=\"?note=8630ed136c8dde2d\" title=\"73-df-dtm-finite-runs\">73-df-dtm-finite-runs</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b9e8acd6d8438a5d\" href=\"?note=b9e8acd6d8438a5d\" title=\"73-df-binary-diagonal-halting\">73-df-binary-diagonal-halting</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-typed-halting-set-notations</span><span>73-definition-8.1</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"219767ec839d8c84\" href=\"?note=219767ec839d8c84\" title=\"73-df-numeric-program-interface\">73-df-numeric-program-interface</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)\">\\(\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b9e8acd6d8438a5d\" href=\"?note=b9e8acd6d8438a5d\" title=\"73-df-binary-diagonal-halting\">73-df-binary-diagonal-halting</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle M,w\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\langle M,w\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\">\\(M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\kappa\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 是固定的接口角色参数：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=0\">\\(\\kappa=0\\)</span> 使用自然数对角集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=1\">\\(\\kappa=1\\)</span> 使用二进制配对语言。原短名称 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 是固定角色下的别名，不把两种不同载体的集合宣告相等。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.1}\\vdash\n\\langle M,w\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\quad(M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}},\\ w\\in\\mathbf2^*)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.1}\\vdash\n\\langle M,w\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\quad(M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}},\\ w\\in\\mathbf2^*)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.1}\\vdash\nK_{\\mathrm{diag}}\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:e\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.1}\\vdash\nK_{\\mathrm{diag}}\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:e\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.1}\\vdash\nK_{\\mathrm{pair}}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle M,w\\rangle:M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\land w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\land\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.1}\\vdash\nK_{\\mathrm{pair}}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle M,w\\rangle:M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\land w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\land\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.1}\\vdash\nK\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}K_{\\mathrm{diag}},&amp;\\kappa=0,\\\\K_{\\mathrm{pair}},&amp;\\kappa=1.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.1}\\vdash\nK\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}K_{\\mathrm{diag}},&amp;\\kappa=0,\\\\K_{\\mathrm{pair}},&amp;\\kappa=1.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原文用两条定义把同一 K 同时定义成自然数集与配对词语言，不能作为无参数的一次定义成立。保留两种原有用法，但将角色选择提升到 Hypothesis；下游必须固定角色。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-numeric-program-interface","status":"resolved","id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-finite-runs","status":"resolved","id":"8630ed136c8dde2d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-finite-runs]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-diagonal-halting","status":"resolved","id":"b9e8acd6d8438a5d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-diagonal-halting]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-numeric-program-interface","status":"resolved","id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]] 的 $\\varphi_e$、[[73-df-binary-program-coding]] 的 $\\mathcal E$；$\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]] 的 $\\varphi_e$、[[73-df-binary-program-coding]] 的 $\\mathcal E$；$\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-diagonal-halting","status":"resolved","id":"b9e8acd6d8438a5d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)$ 见 [[73-df-binary-diagonal-halting]]；$\\langle M,w\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}$，其中 $M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle M,w\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa=1","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.1}\\vdash\n\\langle M,w\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\quad(M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}},\\ w\\in\\mathbf2^*)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.1}\\vdash\nK_{\\mathrm{diag}}\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:e\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.1}\\vdash\nK_{\\mathrm{pair}}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle M,w\\rangle:M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\land w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\land\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.1}\\vdash\nK\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}K_{\\mathrm{diag}},&\\kappa=0,\\\\K_{\\mathrm{pair}},&\\kappa=1.\\end{cases}","display":true}],"bytes":1933,"backlinks":[{"id":"ab2965eae370e771","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\equiv_T$ 见 [[73-df-numeric-turing-reduction]]；$K$ 固定为 [[73-df-typed-halting-set-notations]] 中 $\\kappa=0$ 的数值对角集。"},{"id":"de1cd2013aed2d29","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$K$ 使用 [[73-df-typed-halting-set-notations]] 的固定角色 $\\kappa\\in\\{0,1\\}$；当 $\\kappa=0$ 时，$\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}$ 指 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]] 的 $\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}$；当 $\\kappa=1$ 时指 [[73-df-recursive-language-notation]] 的二进制词语言实例。"}],"outgoing":["219767ec839d